    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 0. TRIGGERS: When a File is Created or Updated in Google Drive Folder\n- The ingestion workflow triggers any time a new file is added or updated to the Google Drive folder where the training data is stored.\n- The workflow can also be triggered manually.\n",
